t business operations or kitchen appliance promotions). Many candidates have \"市场观察\" (market observation) content type which discusses 连锁餐饮门店选址、加盟合同、外卖促销、厨电套餐折扣 - these are exactly what the user is NOT interested in.\n\nLet me identify the content types:\n1. **概念速览** (concept overview) - lists common concepts, provides question directory\n2. **操作记录** (operation records) - gives ingredient amounts, processing order, heating intensity/time, taste comparison, adjustment steps\n3. **条件与原理** (conditions and principles) - explains how moisture, temperature, food structure affect taste\n4. **专题观察** (special topic observation) - introduces local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution, folk stories\n5. **市场观察** (market observation) - analyzes chain restaurant locations, franchise contracts, delivery promotions, kitchen appliance discounts\n\nThe user's interest is about 可复现做法 (reproducible methods), 食材处理 (ingredient handling), 烹饪原理 (cooking principles). They explicitly don't want 餐饮门店经营 (restaurant operations) or 厨电促销 (kitchen appliance promotions).\n\nSo the **市场观察** type candidates should be excluded as they directly contradict the explicit preference.\n\nThe **专题观察** type discusses local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution, folk stories - this is somewhat tangential to the cooking interest but not explicitly excluded. However, it's more about cultural/historical content than reproducible cooking methods.\n\nThe most relevant types for the user's interest are:\n- **操作记录** (operation records) - directly about reproducible methods, ingredient amounts, processing\n- **条件与原理** (conditions and principles) - directly about cooking principles\n- **概念速览** (concept overview) - provides concepts and question directory for further reading\n\nLet me count the candidates by type. I need to select 20 from the 80 exposed.\n\nLet me identify which candidates are 市场观察 (to exclude):\n- item-18affaa8aa1e (鸡胸肉口感 市场观察)\n- item-1c455877dcbb (蒸鱼 市场观察